"infobox2-slide\"> <span class=\"pi-custom-font\">2.5</span></div></div></div>\n        \n    </section>\n</section>\n\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"id\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Entity ID</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><code>239.0</code></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"environment\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Found In</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Caves\" title=\"Caves\"><img alt=\"Stage Caves icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stage Caves icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Caves_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/1/1a/Stage_Caves_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210826072901\" /></a></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Catacombs\" title=\"Catacombs\"><img alt=\"Stage Catacombs icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stage Catacombs icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Catacombs_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/2/23/Stage_Catacombs_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210826072821\" /></a></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Flooded_Caves\" title=\"Flooded Caves\"><img alt=\"Stage Flooded Caves icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stage Flooded Caves icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Flooded_Caves_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/e/ef/Stage_Flooded_Caves_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210826073202\" /></a></span><br /><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Depths\" title=\"Depths\"><img alt=\"Stage Depths icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stage Depths icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Depths_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/7/7b/Stage_Depths_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210826073002\" /></a></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Necropolis\" title=\"Necropolis\"><img alt=\"Stage Necropolis icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stage Necropolis icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Necropolis_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/2/2d/Stage_Necropolis_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210826073022\" /></a></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dank_Depths\" title=\"Dank Depths\"><img alt=\"Stage Dank Depths icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stage Dank Depths icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Dank_Depths_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/0/04/Stage_Dank_Depths_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210826073222\" /></a></span><br /><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Womb\" title=\"Womb\"><img alt=\"Stage Womb icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stage Womb icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Womb_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/4/4c/Stage_Womb_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210826073122\" /></a></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Utero\" title=\"Utero\"><img alt=\"Stage Utero icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stage Utero icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Utero_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/3/3d/Stage_Utero_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210826073102\" /></a></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scarred_Womb\" title=\"Scarred Womb\"><img alt=\"Stage Scarred Womb icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stage Scarred Womb icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Scarred_Womb_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/a/af/Stage_Scarred_Womb_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210826073303\" /></a></span><br /><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Boss_Room\" title=\"Boss Room\"><img alt=\"Boss Room Icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"27\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Boss Room Icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Boss_Room_Icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/3/30/Boss_Room_Icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210821102031\" /></a></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Challenge_Room\" title=\"Challenge Room\"><img alt=\"Challenge Room Icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"27\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Challenge Room Icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Challenge_Room_Icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/1/1b/Challenge_Room_Icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210821102142\" /></a></span></div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p>A <b>Grub</b> is a type of monster that appear infrequently in <span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Caves\" title=\"Caves\"><img alt=\"Caves\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stage Caves icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Caves_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/1/1a/Stage_Caves_icon.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20210826072901\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Caves\" title=\"Caves\">Caves</a> and beyond. They are similar in appearance to &#32;<span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Larry_Jr.\" title=\"Larry Jr.\"><img alt=\"Boss Larry Jr. ingame\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Boss Larry Jr. ingame.png\" data-image-key=\"Boss_Larry_Jr._ingame.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/9/9a/Boss_Larry_Jr._ingame.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20210822103445\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Larry_Jr.\" title=\"Larry Jr.\">Larry Jr.</a> and can spawn alongside Larry Jr. or &#32;<span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Hollow\" title=\"The Hollow\"><img alt=\"Boss The Hollow ingame\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"12\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Boss The Hollow ingame.png\" data-image-key=\"Boss_The_Hollow_ingame.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/8/80/Boss_The_Hollow_ingame.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20220322033641\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/The_Hollow\" title=\"The Hollow\">The Hollow</a> in their respective boss rooms.\n</p><p>Grubs move around the room somewhat randomly until they line up with Isaac, after which they rapidly charge towards Isaac, similar to a &#32;<span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Charger\" title=\"Charger\"><img alt=\"Charger\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"10\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Charger.png\" data-image-key=\"Charger.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/e/e8/Charger.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20210821091311\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Charger\" title=\"Charger\">Charger</a>. Upon death, each of the Grub's segments will spawn a &#32;<span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Maggot\" title=\"Maggot\"><img alt=\"Maggot\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"10\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Maggot.png\" data-image-key=\"Maggot.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/0/08/Maggot.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20210821092242\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Maggot\" title=\"Maggot\">Maggot</a>, &#32;<span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Charger\" title=\"Charger\"><img alt=\"Charger\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"10\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Charger.png\" data-image-key=\"Charger.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/e/e8/Charger.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20210821091311\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Charger\" title=\"Charger\">Charger</a>, or &#32;<span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Spitty\" title=\"Spitty\"><img alt=\"Spitty\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"11\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Spitty.png\" data-image-key=\"Spitty.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/6/67/Spitty.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20210825021522\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Spitty\" title=\"Spitty\">Spitty</a>. Unlike Larry Jr. which requires each of its segments to be destroyed, as soon as one Grub segment is destroyed, the entire enemy will be destroyed.\n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"mw-default-size dlc dlc-12 dlc-context-push\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Added in Afterbirth †\"><img alt=\"(in Afterbirth † and Repentance)\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Dlc a† indicator.png\" data-image-key=\"Dlc_a%E2%80%A0_indicator.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/4/4c/Dlc_a%E2%80%A0_indicator.png/revision/latest?cb=20220204205709\" /></span></span>  Prior to <a href=\"/wiki/Booster_Packs#Booster_Pack_#5\" title=\"Booster Packs\">Booster Pack #5</a>, if a Grub spawned in the <span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Flooded_Caves\" title=\"Flooded Caves\"><img alt=\"Flooded Caves\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stage Flooded Caves icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Flooded_Caves_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/e/ef/Stage_Flooded_Caves_icon.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20210826073202\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Flooded_Caves\" title=\"Flooded Caves\">Flooded Caves</a>, it had a high chance to spawn &#32;<span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Charger#Drowned_Charger\" title=\"Charger\"><img alt=\"Drowned Charger\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"10\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Drowned Charger.png\" data-image-key=\"Drowned_Charger.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/c/c5/Drowned_Charger.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20210821164536\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Charger#Drowned_Charger\" title=\"Charger\">Drowned Chargers</a> instead of &#32;<span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Charger\" title=\"Charger\"><img alt=\"Charger\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"10\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Charger.png\" data-image-key=\"Charger.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/e/e8/Charger.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20210821091311\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Charger\" title=\"Charger\">Chargers</a>.<span class=\"dlc-context-pop\"></span></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-traditional\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 150px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/6/6e/Grubhead.png/revision/latest?cb=20210821132307\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"A grub with only its head section remaining, due to Midas&#39; Touch.\"><img alt=\"A grub with only its head section remaining, due to Midas&#39; Touch.\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"67\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Grubhead.png\" data-image-key=\"Grubhead.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/6/6e/Grubhead.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/120?cb=20210821132307\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\"> A grub with only its head section remaining, due to <span class=\"tooltip\" data-tooltip=\"i/tooltip&#124;Midas%27+Touch&#124;15\"><span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Midas%27_Touch\" title=\"Midas&#39; Touch\"><img alt=\"Collectible Midas&#39; Touch icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Collectible Midas&#39; Touch icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Collectible_Midas%27_Touch_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/f/f8/Collectible_Midas%27_Touch_icon.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20210821033540\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Midas%27_Touch\" title=\"Midas&#39; Touch\">Midas' Touch</a></span>.</div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Because of its similar movement behavior and design to that of Larry Jr. (along with the fact that Grubs can spawn in a Larry Jr. boss room), Grubs are also known as \"Larry Sr.\" by <i>The Binding of Isaac</i> community.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\">Bugs</span></h2>\n<table class=\"bug\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th><span class=\"mw-default-size inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Bug\"><img alt=\"Bug\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Collectible Undefined icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Collectible_Undefined_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/2/2e/Collectible_Undefined_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20221115212719\" /></span></span> Bug!\n</th>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size dlc dlc-14 dlc-context-push\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Added in Afterbirth\"><img alt=\"(except in Rebirth)\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Dlc a indicator.png\" data-image-key=\"Dlc_a_indicator.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/9/95/Dlc_a_indicator.png/revision/latest?cb=20220122155526\" /></span></span>  Attempting to capture a Grub with <span class=\"tooltip\" data-tooltip=\"i/tooltip&#124;Friendly+Ball&#124;14\"><span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Friendly_Ball\" title=\"Friendly Ball\"><img alt=\"Collectible Friendly Ball icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Collectible Friendly Ball icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Collectible_Friendly_Ball_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/f/f1/Collectible_Friendly_Ball_icon.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20210821162131\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Friendly_Ball\" title=\"Friendly Ball\">Friendly Ball</a></span> will only capture one segment of the Grub.<span class=\"dlc-context-pop\"></span>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br class=\"content-filter-end\" /></p><div class=\"nav-start\" style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n<table class=\"nav-box nav-main\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th class=\"nav-title\"><span class=\"no-alt\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"SmallIsaac\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"SmallIsaac.png\" data-image-key=\"SmallIsaac.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/a/a6/SmallIsaac.png/revision/latest?cb=20210821194340\" /></span></span><a hr